01:04:26,666 --> 01:04:32,666
El Cantante (The Singer) is a 2006 biographical film which
stars singers Marc Anthony and Jennifer Lopez.

11
01:10:53,333 --> 01:10:59,333
The film is based on the life of the late salsa singer
Héctor Lavoe, who is portrayed by Anthony.

12
