The film is told from the viewpoint of Puchi, Hector's wife, portrayed by Lopez.

13
01:23:46,666 --> 01:23:52,666
Initially debuting at the Toronto International Film Festival on
September 12, 2006, El Cantante was released on August 3, 2007.

14
01:30:13,333 --> 01:30:19,333
Distributed by Picturehouse, the film runs for 106 minutes and
is rated R for language, sexuality and drug use.

15
